<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINA CLAUSURA CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINA CLAUSURA CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of games played on</p>
<p>the opening weekend of the Argentine Clausura soccer</p>
<p>championship:</p>
<p> Banfield		   1    San Lorenzo	   1</p>
<p> Boca Juniors	     2    Estudiantes	   1</p>
<p> Gimnasia-La Plata	0    River Plate	   2</p>
<p> Huracan		    0    Lanus		   0</p>
<p> Independiente	    2    Ferro Carril Oeste  2</p>
<p> Platense		   1    Gimnasia-Jujuy	1</p>
<p> Rosario Central	  5    Racing Club	   0</p>
<p> Union			0    Corrientes	    0</p>
<p> Velez Sarsfield	  1    Newell's Old Boys   1</p>
<p>Note: the Clausura is the second of two championships</p>
<p>played in the Argentine season. The teams play each other once</p>
<p>in each and there is no overall champion.</p>
</text>
